.TH REPUNSEL 6.SH NAMErepunsel \- a filter of garden puns.SH SYNOPSIS\fBrepunsel\fR< infile.SH DESCRIPTIONA filter: every word it has a garden pun for comes out as the pun, incapitals --\fBAnd I would root\fRbecomes\fBANT I WOOD ROOT\fR.\fRWords it has no pun for pass through..SH SEE ALSOpig, valspeak